{%- comment -%} build: mx-plate-landing-v2b {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Custom Motocross Number Plate Hats (threadbreak.com/pages/custom-motocross-number-plate-hats)
  Template suffix: mx-plate-order  (templates/page.mx-plate-order.liquid)

  Self-contained and #tbmx-scoped, same approach as page.patch-order.liquid.
  The 24 plate designs are inline vector art from NumberPlates.ai (artboard n = data-plate n).
  Brand -> plate mapping lives in the BRANDS array in the script at the bottom.

  STILL TO DO (placeholders on purpose):
  1. HATS[].colors is a placeholder BASIC list. Replace with the real per-style colorways
     from the STYLES data in page.custom-order.liquid / page.patch-order.liquid, and set
     HATS[].img to each style's photo URL (the preview falls back to a drawn hat).
  2. #addBtn currently opens a prefilled email to help@threadbreak.com (no checkout yet).
     Wire it to the cart (hat tier variant + line item properties) when ready.
  3. Gallery: no customer photos yet, so the section is left out. Add one when there are photos.
  4. Pricing constants live in TIERS at the top of the script: Otto 39.95/25.00/20.00,
     Richardson/Yupoong/Flexfit 44.95/29.95/24.95; 2 to 4 hats = 10% off each; 10+ stays at the 10-hat price.
{%- endcomment -%}
