<div class="wrap">
<div class="kicker">Threadbreak &middot; Custom Hats</div>
<h1 class="headline">Your number.<br>Your plate.<br><span class="mx-accent">Your hat.</span></h1>
<p class="sub">A custom leatherette patch styled after your bike's actual number plate — your name and number, laser engraved and heat pressed onto the hat of your choice.</p>
<a href="#builder" class="cta">Build your plate</a>
<div class="trust">
<span class="mx-trust-item">Made in Burlington, NC</span>
<span class="mx-trust-item">From $39.95, free shipping to the lower 48</span>
<span class="mx-trust-item">Laser engraved, not printed</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="checker"></div>
<section class="mx-steps">
<div class="wrap">
<h2 class="section-title">How it comes together</h2>
<p class="lede">Three choices and it's ready to build.</p>
<div class="step-list">
<div class="mx-step">
<div class="mx-step-num">1</div>
<div class="step-body">
<h3>Pick your bike brand</h3>
<p>Each brand has its own number plate shapes: KTM, Honda, Yamaha, Kawasaki, and more.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mx-step">
<div class="mx-step-num">2</div>
<div class="step-body">
<h3>Pick a design</h3>
<p>A few styles per brand, cut to the shape of the real plate.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mx-step">
<div class="mx-step-num">3</div>
<div class="step-body">
<h3>Add your number and name</h3>
<p>Type them in, choose your leatherette color, and we engrave it exactly as ordered.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mx-step">
<div class="mx-step-num">4</div>
<div class="step-body">
<h3>Pick your hat</h3>
<p>Choose the style and color. Order 2 or more and every hat costs less, and each hat can be a different color.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="reviews">
<div class="wrap">
{%- assign jm = shop.metafields.judgeme -%}
<p class="rating-line"><span class="mx-stars" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> {{ jm.all_reviews_rating | default: 5.0 | round: 1 }}/5{% if jm.all_reviews_count %} &middot; <span class="rating-count-inline">{{ jm.all_reviews_count }}</span> reviews{% else %} from our customers{% endif %} &middot; <a href="/pages/reviews" class="rating-link">Read the reviews</a></p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="builder-slot" id="builder">
<div class="wrap">
<h2 class="section-title">Build your plate</h2>
<p class="lede">Pick your bike, a design, and a color.</p>
<div class="form" id="plateForm" style="--leather:#a9713e">
<div class="field-block">
<div class="field-label"><span class="n">1</span> Bike brand</div>
<div class="chip-row" id="brandRow"></div>
</div>
<div class="field-block" id="designBlock">
<div class="field-label"><span class="n">2</span> Design</div>
<p class="hint" id="designHint">Choose a brand first.</p>
